      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000009" id="METEXC_k" name="rate of feces excretion" value="0.0006" units="per_min" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>The transit of the content of the gut lumen into the feces, the
colonic transit time of 24-36 hr (mean residence 1/METEXC_k = 28 hr).
