        </notes>
      </parameter>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="f_abcb1" name="PG activity" value="1" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>parameter controls activity (1.0 reference activity,
&lt; 1.0 reduced activity, &gt; 1.0 increased activity)</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000009" id="f_LOSEFL_k" name="fractional rate losartan efflux (PG)" value="1" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>The efflux relative to the absorption, not fitted: the
absorption is nearly complete, so the efflux delays the
absorption (the ABCB1 genotypes change Cmax and the early AUC,
not the AUC [Shin2020]) and is not identifiable separately
from <code>LOSABS_k</code>.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
